# Local env files
# `.env` itself was NOT listed here and was tracked, so anything put in it — including the
# Supabase service_role key, which bypasses RLS on every table — went straight into git on
# the next commit. Ignoring it is only half the fix: git keeps tracking a file it already
# tracks, so it also has to be removed from the index with `git rm --cached .env`.
.env
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local

